Ga₂O₃ defect dichroism
Copyright (c) 2026 Felipe Bermudez Mendoza

Software package version: 0.1.1

This repository contains software utilities and example CRYSTAL23 input decks
for preparing and analyzing calculations associated with a β-Ga₂O₃ vacancy,
self-trapped-hole, and optical-dichroism study.

Associated manuscript status
----------------------------
The associated manuscript is under review at the time this package was
prepared. A public Research Square version is available at:

https://www.researchsquare.com/article/rs-9008105/v1

